WEBVTT

NOTE AI-generated fictional adult narrator and voice. Data figures use retained NASA POWER records.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.030
Can one city tell two climate

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:02.623
stories?

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.672
Look at Tehran's rainfall.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.468
Over 45 years, the fitted trend

00:00:07.468 --> 00:00:08.318
points up.

00:00:08.709 --> 00:00:10.761
Over 15, it points down.

00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:12.239
The dates changed.

00:00:12.985 --> 00:00:14.781
That doesn't prove the climate reversed.

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:17.320
Climate Explorer lets you test that

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.781
difference with NASA data.

00:00:19.389 --> 00:00:21.914
Compare periods, inspect uncertainty,

00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:23.941
and save the evidence so someone

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:25.323
else can check your result.

00:00:26.049 --> 00:00:28.138
Before sharing a claim, check what

00:00:28.138 --> 00:00:28.672
changed.
